<D.RUFFER>    ( KWIK Sort Algorithm )
<D.RUFFER> : DOWN ( # - #')  BEGIN  DUP COMPARE  0> WHILE  1+  REPEAT ;
<D.RUFFER> : UP   ( # - #')  BEGIN  DUP COMPARE  0< WHILE  1-  REPEAT ;
<D.RUFFER>
<D.RUFFER> : EXCHANGE ( #1 #2 - #1' #2')   BEGIN  SWAP DOWN  SWAP UP
<D.RUFFER>       2DUP > NOT IF  2DUP TRADE  SWAP 1+  SWAP 1-  THEN
<D.RUFFER>       2DUP > UNTIL ;
<D.RUFFER>
<D.RUFFER> : EOL ( # n1 n2 - ... #')   SWAP 2>R  BEGIN  I I'
<D.RUFFER>       2DUP + 2/ KEEP  EXCHANGE  R> ROT >R  SWAP 2DUP <
<D.RUFFER>       IF  ROT 1+  ELSE  2DROP  THEN
<D.RUFFER>       I I' < NOT UNTIL  2R> 2DROP ;
<D.RUFFER>
<D.RUFFER> : KWIK ( n)   SORTER ASSIGN  0 SWAP 1-  1
<D.RUFFER>    BEGIN  1-  ROT ROT EOL  ?DUP 0= UNTIL ;

